<title>ALBANIA: Albanian October CPI up 1.6 pct m/m, 18.8 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Albanian October CPI up 1.6 pct m/m, 18.8 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>TIRANA 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Albania's Institute of Statistics reported the following main economic indicator on Monday:</p>
<p> ALBANIAN INFLATION	   OCT 96    SEPT 96	OCT 95</p>
<p> Monthly CPI change (pct)   +1.6	 +2.5	  +0.7</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr change	     +18.8	+17.7	  +5.76</p>
<p> Index (Dec 1993=100)	141.53     139.34	119.17</p>
<p>-- Tirana Newsroom, +355 42 62228</p>
</text>
